1
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:06,280
The council's emissary had been roaming
through the desert

2
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,700
for days on end.

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:12,900
Here, at the roots of humanity, he was
searching for a clue

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:16,160
about how to defeat the dark shadows,

5
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:20,740
the evil which was reaching out for the
hearts of the humans

6
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,300
and threatening to destroy them.

7
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:30,100
He had almost given up hope when at last
he found them,

8
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,640
the old writings the council had talked
of.

9
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:36,900
They were carved in stone

10
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:41,080
and told the stories of eight mighty
buildings.

11
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:47,200
These wonders of the world had been
erected eons ago

12
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,700
when evil had tried to destroy the world.

13
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:57,100
A mighty power was concealed within them,

14
00:00:57,320 --> 00:01:00,480
a force which had once defeated the
shadows

15
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:02,700
and banished them from the earth.

16
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:05,540
But in the course of the centuries,

17
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:07,820
the wonders of the world had crumbled

18
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:10,300
and their powers had disappeared.

19
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:12,440
The emissary could only hope

20
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:15,100
that the council knew what had to be done.

21
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:18,620
Exhausted, he began to make his way.
